      "type": "DSA_TRACE_INTERVALS",
      "narration": "Next is eight to ten. Does eight come before six? It doesn't, so there's a gap. The else branch runs and we append it as a separate block. Two blocks now. That's the entire decision the algorithm ever makes: overlap means widen, gap means append. One comparison per booking, and it never revisits a decision it has already taken. That refusal to look back is exactly what the word greedy means.",
